{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38346","headline":"中夜闻啼禽 · 吴融","name":"中夜闻啼禽","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"漠漠苍苍未五更，宿禽何处两三声。\n若非西涧回波触，即是南塘急雨惊。\n金屋独眠堪寄恨，商陵永诀更牵情。\n此时归梦随肠断，半壁残灯闪闪明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38346.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38346","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}